<title>USA: Canisteo CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>Canisteo CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $9.800 million of Canisteo CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.065 percent.</p>
